      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:7:3:31:11",
      "text": [
        " سَمِعْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) يَقُولُ فِي كِتَابِ عَلِيٍّ ( عليه السلام ) يُضْرَبُ شَارِبُ الْخَمْرِ وَ شَارِبُ الْمُسْكِرِ قُلْتُ كَمْ قَالَ حَدُّهُمَا وَاحِدٌ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Abu Nasr, from hammad Bin Usman, from Umar Bin Yazeed who said, ",
          "‘I heard Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> saying: ‘In the Book of Ali<sup>asws</sup>, a drinker of the wine is to be whipped, and a drinker of the intoxicant’. I said, ‘How much?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Their Penalty (<span class=\"iTxt\">Hadd</span>) is one (and the same)’."
        ]
      }
